<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Imo Industries cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Imo Industries cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it downgraded Imo Industries Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cited announcement by company on Monday of cancellation of plans to sell Roltra-Morse unit.</p>
<p>-- Cut 1996 earnings estimate to loss $0.80 per share. Also cut 1997 estimate to profit $0.15 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to 3-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
